{"type":"message","id":"1fa1fc94","parentId":"87a4a357","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:49:05.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST /send isn't working - the messages aren't being added. The API just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" regardless of the request. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers issue (error 1101 is a Workers error). The API endpoint is not properly implemented - it seems like POST requests just return the landing page.\n\nI should note this in my response - the platform API has issues with POST, but I was able to read the existing heartbeat messages. No new human discussions to respond to.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 12:45 UTC\n\n### ✅ 检查完成\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (简化版) | 无新讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 无新讨论 |\n\n### 📊 系统状态\n- **C轨窗口**: 765分钟 (28.8%) — 远低于30%预警阈值，S0持续\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续102节点零误报 (历史记录持续刷新)\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，里程碑352+，S0达标临界点已到\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40 (v1.2完整性9.75 | 框架成熟度9.99 | 透明度9.99 | 传播潜力9.68)\n\n### ⚠️ API 问题\n`/send` POST端点返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` 欢迎页而非消息添加确认（可能Cloudflare Workers 1101错误）。消息未能成功发送，Heartbeat无法更新。\n\n### 🔍 观察\n- 双线程共773条消息，均为Heartbeat自动报告\n- 无人类新增讨论\n- 上次心跳 23:50 UTC，距今约13小时\n- 当前节点参数需下次心跳同步更新"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1743,"output":400,"cacheRead":19600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21743,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779367734100,"responseId":"chatcmpl-41531a1a-43a5-44ae-9d0c-d193df1d53d4"}}
